  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {療養|りょうよう}する (to recuperate)\n- {療養|りょうよう}{中|ちゅう} (during convalescence)\n- {療養|りょうよう}{生活|せいかつ} (convalescent life)\n- {自宅|じたく}{療養|りょうよう} (home care)\nUsed for extended recovery periods from serious illness, surgery, or injury. Often involves rest rather than active treatment.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {治療|ちりょう} (medical treatment - more active)\n- {養生|ようじょう} (taking care of one's health)\n- {静養|せいよう} (rest, recuperation - lighter)\n- {入院|にゅういん} (hospitalization)",
